{\plain {\b Gib3_3.mcd}{   The Fourier transform
 of a "triangular pulse" will be evaluated
 by three methods:\par      1.  analytic
 evaluation "with paper and pencil and integral
 tables" }{\par      2.  evaluation using
 the symbolic math capability of Mathcad\par 
     3.  numerical evaluation by \par   
        a. Mathcad's built-in integration
 capability\par           b. By DFT, using
 Mathcad's built-in FFT.}}
}
